00:00:36.550 --> 00:00:37.510
So you can think
about encryption

00:00:37.510 --> 00:00:39.640
in three different states--
encryption at rest,

00:00:39.640 --> 00:00:41.974
encryption in transit,
or encryption in use.

00:00:41.974 --> 00:00:43.390
Encryption at rest
is what you use

00:00:43.390 --> 00:00:46.870
to protect your data
from exfiltration,

00:00:46.870 --> 00:00:48.730
