again, by default.

00:01:23.840 --> 00:01:26.400
You don't have to configure
any of that for your data

00:01:26.400 --> 00:01:27.970
in transit.

00:01:27.970 --> 00:01:30.850
The last point here,
data encryption in use,

00:01:30.850 --> 00:01:32.740
