that I've talked about
today, additional information

00:27:51.070 --> 00:27:53.147
on the white paper I mentioned.

00:27:53.147 --> 00:27:54.730
We have a couple of
code labs that you

00:27:54.730 --> 00:27:56.688
can do using Cloud KMS,
so there's actually one

00:27:56.688 --> 00:27:58.695
if you go to the first
